# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VOIDHACK 2026 — Edge Function secrets: send-registration-email
# Copy to supabase/functions/.env.local for `supabase functions serve`
# or set as project-wide secrets with:
#
#   supabase secrets set SMTP_USER=... SMTP_PASS=...
#
# SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are injected automatically by the
# Edge Runtime — never set them here. Secrets NEVER go in the browser.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ---- SMTP (Nodemailer) ----------------------------------------
# Defaults target Gmail (smtp.gmail.com:465) using an App Password:
# https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-app-password-goes-here

# Optional override of the From header (defaults to SMTP_USER).
# EMAIL_FROM="VOIDHACK 2026 <noreply@your-domain.in>"

# NOTE: free-Gmail bulk sends often land in spam; a verified custom
# domain (Resend/SendGrid + SPF/DKIM) is the reliable fix.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────